os/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/123/labels","id":6683829,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjY4MzgyOQ==","number":123,"title":"2.0.0.Alpha2","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":148,"state":"closed","created_at":"2021-04-21T11:09:48Z","updated_at":"2021-07-29T09:38:41Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-05-06T08:30:39Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2021-04-20T07:35:38Z","updated_at":"2021-04-27T16:47:44Z","closed_at":"2021-04-27T16:47:42Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Describe the bug\r\n\r\nAccording to the guide `https://quarkus.io/guides/native-and-ssl`, for native, the next SSL configuration needs to be set:\r\n\r\n```\r\n-H:EnableURLProtocols=http,https --enable-all-security-services -H:+JNI\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe problem is that these properties are not being set by default:\r\n- Creating a new app using Maven command line:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmvn io.quarkus:quarkus-maven-plugin:1.13.2.Final:create \\\r\n    -DprojectGroupId=org.acme \\\r\n    -DprojectArtifactId=rest-json-quickstart \\\r\n    -DclassName=\"org.acme.rest.json.FruitResource\" \\\r\n    -Dpath=\"/fruits\" \\\r\n    -Dextensions=\"resteasy,resteasy-jackson\"\r\ncd rest-json-quickstart\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdding the `server.keystore` into `src/main/resources/META-INF/resources`.\r\nHaving the properties:\r\n\r\n```\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-file=META-INF/resources/server.keystore\r\nquarkus.http.ssl.certificate.key-store-password=password\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt seems that I need to provide also the following property:\r\n\r\n```\r\nquarkus.ssl.native=true\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd also I think the guide should say that the ssl certificates should be under the `src/main/resources/META-INF/resources` folder.\r\n\r\n## Environment (please complete the following information):\r\n\r\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\r\n### Quarkus version or git rev\r\n1.13.2.Final","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/16651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0